  "bodyHash": "59cf70d41fa67b4c",
  "content": "<p><strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">想要在新更新、幕后花絮或额外福利方面获得抢先体验，同时支持我和 Reimagined 的开发吗？</span> 考虑捐赠给我的 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/Reijvi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon！&lt;3</a></span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://gyazo.com/b1a381494dca16aaaab3e5a8ae288edd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>Reimagined，一封写给 Minecraft 的情书</h2>\n<p>Reimagined 是一个持续开发的项目，它是一个广泛的 overhaul（重构/重制），以大大小小的方式尽可能多地改变游戏内容。从数百种新的方块变体、完全重新制作的 GUI、新音效、动画、生物群系颜色、生物、粒子等等！希望 Reimagined 拥有人们可以享受的一切。</p>\n<p>最终，希望 Reimagined 能让你的像素世界感觉更像是一个真正鲜活的世界，让你沉浸其中，同时依然保持那份舒适熟悉的 Minecraft 魅力。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://gyazo.com/9cef9a67335ae61963102acebc66a831.png\" alt=\"image\"> <img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/14e4ffe26741511cf22d3b7558a49749.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">要获得所有 Reimagined 的功能，请使用以下模组！</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a> &amp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a> </span> 用于自定义生物模型</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpolytone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">POLYTONE</a> </span> 用于更好的颜色映射、更好的 Sodium 兼容性等（村民 GUI 用于 1.21.6 之前的版本）</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcontinuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CONTINUITY</a></span> 用于连接纹理，如木板边框、地毯连接纹理、草覆盖层等</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frespackopts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">RESPACKOPTS 1.21+</a></span> 用于通过游戏内设置进一步自定义 Reimagined。目前需要此模组来启用改进的草地或多叶树叶，因为它是通过设置启用的。\n如果你想在没有 Respackopts 的情况下使用多叶草地，请务必使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fgrassy-grass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Grassy Grass Addon</a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodefite-item-definition-backport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MODEFITE PRE-1.21.4</a></span>\n用于向后移植来自较新版本的功能，包括手持物品时的 3D 桶等功能。如果你使用的是 1.21.4+ 版本，则不需要此模组。\n<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1011243706063527961/1069384365785743534/line2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1011243706063527961/1069297933293473852/features.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>一些值得注意的功能：</h1>\n<h2>全新的 Reimagined GUI</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c6c24a86651c1fd2bdb63efe61a1c0b6c908ff3c.gif\" alt=\"Villager\"> <img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/03429a864bce71ba4e9d39227015e585.png\" alt=\"Furnace\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/dc295d3091dc4082bf2eb5123e9fc46d.gif\" alt=\"Features\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://gyazo.com/7af08c39ca84dcc08a7e2e141621649a.gif\" alt=\"Crafting_Table\"></p>\n<h2>动画功能</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://gyazo.com/858b33a23b1e0aefdafc7288ac550f39.gif\" alt=\"Features\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/4e06e8b3a30899317d62a3a80591fe93.gif\" alt=\"Furnaces\"></p>\n<h1>沉浸式世界</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/50705d325739837448b00922638d581a.gif\" alt=\"Features\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/d49d870458a3b3a532958d17a790eac9.gif\" alt=\"Jungle\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://gyazo.com/edf3610d77713118dcfa387fd4b40f87.gif\" alt=\"ArmorLantern\"></p>\n<h1>新的植被</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/407695f8d0fcf777e820fa97adf82e06.gif\" alt=\"Foliage\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/8ab4ac943dab9bab4db4ff8c3dd1b11a.gif\" alt=\"Foliage\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://gyazo.com/a5551d9520105d6354a3bbd74451b1da.gif\" alt=\"Savanna\"></p>\n<h1>生物变异</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/d65f998f901d85251282224ec6b886c9.png\" alt=\"Skellies\"></p>\n<h1>以及更多更多！</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1011243706063527961/1069384365785743534/line2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252freijvi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/aa729799ffa7b99f1cf7b14c3e8cf79e.png\" alt=\"Donate\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1011243706063527961/1069296962010091630/addons.png\" width=\"1338\" height=\"91\"></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>附加组件 (ADDONS)：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/reimagined-fresh-animations-patch\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations 兼容补丁</a><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/dark-gui-reimagined/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#2b3e50\">深色 GUI</span></a></span></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252freimagined-colormap-fix%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#999\"><strong><br>白色颜色映射修复</strong></span></a></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/reimagined-night-panaroma\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#339\"><strong>夜间全景</strong></span></a></span><br><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><span style=\"color:#396\"><span style=\"color:#9c0;font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/reimagined-3d\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reimagined 3D+</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/reimagined-bushy-leaves\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#008000\">多叶树叶启用器</span></strong></a></span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>非官方附加组件 (UNOFFICIAL ADDONS)：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/spryzeens-health-bars/files/4072909\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#0cf\">生命条 (Spryzeen 的生命条兼容附加组件)</span></a><br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#808080\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252femissive-ores-fore-mc-reimagined-by-reijvi%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#f1c40f\">发光矿石</span></a></span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#808080\"><strong><br></strong></span><span style=\"color:#808080\"><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fminecraft-reimagined-dark-mode-gui%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#2b3e50\">深色模式 GUI</span></a></span></strong></span></span></p></div>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1011243706063527961/1069384365785743534/line2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;font-size:18px\">建议在美国英语语言下游玩，</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;因为我重命名并修改了一些文本颜色和名称，其中一些会影响 GUI！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1011243706063527961/1069384365785743534/line2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>特别感谢：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><strong>鸣谢 (CREDITS)：</strong></p><p>-un_roman, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fun_roman%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">(PMC)</a> 非常友善，并创建了 Reimagined 的文字标志！</p><p>-RickyMemester, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252f1-17-style-variated-ores%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">(PMC) </a>允许我借用他的一些原始矿石纹理变体，这些我之前在我的旧版“Randomize It”中使用过，并进行了大量修改。</p><p>-DartCat25, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fdartcat25%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">(PMC) </a>允许我借用他的“Menus - Enchanted”，以及他的“Rotating Items”着色器，以使 Reimagined 的一些功能正常工作。</p><p>-Godlander, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fgodlander%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">(PMC) </a>允许我借用他的“Animated Skin”着色器，以使 Reimagined 的一些功能正常工作。</p><p>-Cosmoman, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fcosmoman_476%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">(PMC)</a> 帮助并贡献了大量纹理，移植了深板岩矿石、一致性更改等。</p><p>-ShrimpSnail, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fshrimpsnail%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">(PMC)</a> 让我借用并重新利用了他们《The Great Shrimpsby》包中的附魔书动画。</p><p>-EwanHowell, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fewanhowell5195%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">(PMC)</a> 帮助了我很多，多得数不过来，这也是我甚至知道如何制作资源包的最大原因。</p><p>-Barebones, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/bb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>(Resource Pack)</strong></a> 用于全景图。</p><p>-Complementary Reimagined 作为首选截图着色器（我知道这很讽刺）</p></div>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/rstmkrGeFJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1011243706063527961/1069439024659447868/discord_big_big.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpartners.shockbyte.com%252freimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/5a2618c30403aaceb78a5bceb2b8efd2.png\" width=\"1148\" height=\"191\"></span></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;undefined</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpartners.shockbyte.com%252freimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">undefined</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpartners.shockbyte.com%252freimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#036\">想要支持 Reimagined 吗？<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">无需额外费用</span>，通过此链接进行的购买，我将获得部分收入</span> undefinedthis linkundefined</strong></em></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\"><em><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#036;text-decoration:underline\"><br></span></span></strong></em></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252freijvi\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span> <em><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#036;text-decoration:underline\">或者你可以在此捐赠到我的 Ko-fi！</span></span></strong></em></span></a></span></p>",
